                "kind": "site",
                "id": "memory-site"
              },
              "sentence": "The site `memory-site` is “Memory Site”, a version 5 site document; its void is transparent, its lighting bright and its standing rule centre-covered.",
              "path": "key"
            },
            {
              "kind": "place.regions",
              "about": {
                "kind": "site",
                "id": "memory-site"
              },
              "sentence": "The floor is 2 regions with cells: West room (region-west) and East room (region-east). Summarised: their cells, lighting and ground are not said one by one.",
              "path": "room.room.regions"
            },
            {
              "kind": "place.geometry",
              "about": {
                "kind": "site",
                "id": "memory-site"
              },
              "sentence": "Summarised: the coordinate frame, 1 wall line with 1 door in their openings, 0 scene items, 0 prop footprints and 0 arrangements. Their positions and shapes are not said one by one.",
              "path": "room.room.walls"
            },
            {
              "kind": "place.start",
              "about": {
                "kind": "site",
                "id": "memory-site"
              },
              "sentence": "The party starts at q 0, r 1, in West room (region-west).",
