                "kind": "creature",
                "id": "g"
              },
              "sentence": "While its routine is in the state `alert` and it stands, up, on q 2, r 0, Guard (g) holds the door `gate-door`: every creature not allied with Guard (g) is barred from crossing it, one way: a crossing that starts on the post's side, West room (region-west), and ends on the far side (the other way is not barred). Several holders hold one door: it is held while any of them holds it.",
